        <p class="text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-8 italic">
          A warm mist humidifier boils or heats water before it reaches the room. That makes it the most hygienic type you can buy and the most expensive to run, and it puts a pot of hot water within reach of anyone in the house. Buy one for the first reason, budget for the second, and place it with the third in mind.
