          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The <strong class="text-white">best warm mist humidifier</strong> for most homes is the <strong class="text-white">Levoit LV600HH</strong>, a hybrid that runs cool most of the time and warm when the house is at its driest, with a humidity sensor that keeps the 280-watt heater in check. The <strong class="text-white">Pure Enrichment HumeXL Pro</strong> does much of the same for less, and the <strong class="text-white">Vicks V745A</strong> is the inexpensive boiling unit for hard-water homes.
          </p>
